{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.MassTowerCoefficientStratification","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.MassTowerCoefficientStratification","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelWeightBoundedness"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.mass_tower_coefficient_stratification","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.mass_tower_coefficient_stratification","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/mass-tower-coefficient-stratification.lean#L42-L64","doc":"**Proposition (mass-tower strata are exhausted by depths 0–4).**\n\nEvery `MassTowerTerm` is assigned a stratum depth in the range\n`0 … 4`; no term escapes the finite stratification the mass tower\nis built on.\n\n**Scope.** This is the well-definedness half of\n`prop:mass-tower-coefficient-stratification`. The full narrative\nclaim — that each prefactor *equals* the Plancherel-weighted\nFrobenius integral over the partitions of its stratum — is not\nformalised here; it needs the Frobenius-integral machinery, which\nis not yet available in Lean. What is proved is falsifiable (it\nwould fail if any constructor were assigned a depth above 4) and\nis checked by exhaustion over the constructors.\n\nNote the depth map is deliberately **not** injective: `.pair` and\n`.knotFactor` both sit at depth 2, and `.volume` and `.pauli` both\nat depth 0, so no uniqueness claim is available or intended. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:mass-tower-coefficient-stratification","label":"prop:mass-tower-coefficient-stratification","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/mass-tower-coefficient-stratification.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.stratumDepth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.stratumDepth","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/mass-tower-coefficient-stratification.lean#L32-L40","doc":"The forced depth (or stratum identifier) for each QOU mass-tower term. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm.pauli","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm.pauli","kind":"ctor","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/mass-tower-coefficient-stratification.lean#L30-L30","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm.knotFactor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm.knotFactor","kind":"ctor","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/mass-tower-coefficient-stratification.lean#L29-L29","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm.shell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm.shell","kind":"ctor","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/mass-tower-coefficient-stratification.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm.wigner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm.wigner","kind":"ctor","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/mass-tower-coefficient-stratification.lean#L27-L27","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm.pair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm.pair","kind":"ctor","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/mass-tower-coefficient-stratification.lean#L26-L26","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm.surface","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm.surface","kind":"ctor","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/mass-tower-coefficient-stratification.lean#L25-L25","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm.volume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm.volume","kind":"ctor","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/mass-tower-coefficient-stratification.lean#L24-L24","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassTowerTerm","kind":"inductive","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/mass-tower-coefficient-stratification.lean#L22-L30","doc":"Mapping from QOU mass-tower term to curvature-rank stratum. ","signatureChunk":0}]}